From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:50:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wpt: Run the ecmascript tests

/ecmascript/ (locale-compat.html, regexp-lookbehind.html) was never
added to include.ini. Both tests pass with SpiderMonkey and, since the
previous patch, with QuickJS. locale-compat checks date and time
formats that sites depend on.

Validation: `./mach test-wpt tests/wpt/tests/ecmascript` ran both tests as expected with SpiderMonkey and with `--js-engine quickjs`; on servo-quickjs fdb3eab, locale-compat fails 4 subtests.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; written by the agent, which also ran the WPT runs above)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 tests/wpt/include.ini | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tests/wpt/include.ini b/tests/wpt/include.ini
index f08edda2531..84a653b6169 100644
--- a/tests/wpt/include.ini
+++ b/tests/wpt/include.ini
@@ -146,6 +146,8 @@ skip: true
   skip: false
 [domxpath]
   skip: false
+[ecmascript]
+  skip: false
 [editing]
   skip: false
 [encoding]
